description: "Six questions a reader with a logic background asks the solve first, one declared group each, whole-block copies of the toy battery with suffixed ids. The head of each group states the question and the measured answer under the shipped solve (the map read as its own Bayesian network, D161); the gauges under it show the same numbers live."
